<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HealthCare COMPARE raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HealthCare COMPARE raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth Inc said Wednesday it upgraded HealthCompare COMPARE Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- It said in a report that overall market conditions for the company's primary businesses continue to show favorable trends, with new business opportunities above expectations.</p>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth's 12-month price target for the stock is $60.</p>
<p>-- HealthCare COMPARE was trading at 45-3/4, up 1-3/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
